Swopblock Network — Public Licensing Announcement (SNL 1.0)

Swopblock LLC is announcing a permanent and expanded No Dual Licensing Guarantee covering all software, all copyrights, all patents and patent pending technologies, and the complete cryptographic monetary medium that defines the Swopblock Medium of Crypto Exchange Network, publicly identified by the Swopblock LLC trademark SWOBL.

Swopblock LLC is the creator and rights holder of the Swopblock Network, its deterministic lineage architecture, and the cryptographic exchange medium built upon a fixed Face Value supply of 52,800,000 units, traded under the Swopblock LLC trademark SWOBL. Effective immediately, Swopblock LLC commits that no component of this technology — including the fixed supply exchange medium, deterministic lineage system, genesis anchored identity model, attestation mechanisms, or any other proprietary invention — will ever be relicensed under an alternative license that grants exclusive rights, closed source privileges, or competitive advantage outside the terms of the Swopblock Network License (SNL 1.0 and its future versions).

Swopblock LLC grants all users a perpetual, worldwide right to use, study, and implement the Swopblock Network and its fixed supply Medium of Crypto Exchange, traded as SWOBL, as open source software under the terms of SNL 1.0.

No entity may issue, represent, maintain, denominate, or account for any off chain, custodial, synthetic, ledger based, credit based, derivative based, or IOU based claim in SWOBL under any circumstances. SWOBL may only exist as on chain units governed exclusively by the deterministic lineage architecture. No off chain claims, backed or unbacked, are permitted. Custodial pooling of SWOBL units is prohibited; each user’s SWOBL must remain individually lineage anchored. Rehypothecation, pledging, collateral reuse, or any form of secondary use of SWOBL units held on behalf of another party is prohibited. No entity may create financial instruments, derivatives, leveraged products, or notional value instruments denominated in SWOBL. No entity may issue stablecoins or pegged assets whose value is defined relative to SWOBL. No entity may create or operate bridges, relays, cross chain representations, wrapped tokens, or Layer 2 scaling systems for SWOBL. No entity may fork, replicate, or derive a competing network from the Swopblock deterministic lineage architecture.

This guarantee applies universally to:
•	all Swopblock LLC software
•	all copyrighted works
•	all patented and patent pending technologies
•	all cryptographic exchange mechanisms
•	all deterministic identity and lineage systems
•	all components of the fixed supply monetary medium, including the Swopblock LLC trademark SWOBL

This commitment ensures that the 52,800,000 unit Face Value supply — the foundational medium of crypto exchange within the Swopblock Network — will never be subject to exclusive licensing, proprietary forks, closed commercial arrangements, fractional reserve representations, synthetic exposure, derivative distortion, custodial pooling, or cross chain replication. Every participant in the Swopblock ecosystem receives equal and permanent access under the same license terms.

Swopblock LLC rejects the industry practice of releasing technology under an open license only to later introduce a closed commercial license that divides the ecosystem. The Swopblock Network will grow under a single, unified license that applies equally to all users, without exception.

This announcement does not reduce Swopblock LLC’s patent rights. All patent licensing continues under SNL 1.0 and future versions. The No Dual Licensing Guarantee protects fairness and stability while ensuring Swopblock LLC can enforce its intellectual property only to safeguard the Swopblock ecosystem.

Swopblock LLC is committed to building a secure, deterministic, and trust anchored network environment. Today’s expanded guarantee reinforces that commitment and provides enduring assurance to everyone who depends on the Swopblock Network and its fixed supply Medium of Crypto Exchange, publicly traded under the Swopblock LLC trademark SWOBL.
